Predictive Maintenance Pipeline

Overview:
This project predicts machine failures using machine learning and simulates a real-world predictive maintenance system.

The pipeline trains an XGBoost model on the AI4I 2020 Predictive Maintenance Dataset, stores simulated sensor data in MySQL, displays predictions through a Streamlit dashboard, and automates testing using Jenkins CI/CD.

 Features
 Machine failure prediction using XGBoost
 Real-time sensor simulation
 MySQL database integration
 Interactive Streamlit dashboard
 Automated testing with PyTest
 Jenkins CI/CD pipeline
 GitHub integration

 Tech Stack:
