Workflow:

1. Train model using AI4I dataset.
2. Save trained model as model.pkl.
3. Generate live sensor readings.
4. Store sensor data in MySQL.
5. Predict machine failures.
6. Display results in Streamlit dashboard.
7. Run automated tests through Jenkins.

Results:
The model successfully predicts machine health status and displays confidence scores through the dashboard.

